Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
You can choose what type of correspondence you receive from Qantas through your Frequent flyer account.<br />
<br />
It’s quite easy, all you need to do is:
<ul>
	<li>Log into your Frequent Flyer account&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Under ‘Your Profile’, select ‘Interest and Subscriptions’&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Select which emails you’d like to receive and click on ‘Update Details’ to save your preferences.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
